 single player or with a friend via local-coop. You'll be able to play missions either solo or with a space friend.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play online with Steam's Remote Play Together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manipulate incredibly expensive space vehicles and elaborate machinery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylised 70s visual aesthetic influenced by archival space photography and technical illustration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customisable control mode difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebindable controls</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Accessibility</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A comprehensive list of accessibility features and notes can be found at the Family Gaming Database.</p>","developers":["2pt Interactive"],"dlc":[2391340],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1138850/header.jpg?t=1764589319","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2024, 2pt Pty Ltd","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OS X 10.12<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Controller Recommended</li></ul>"},"metacritic":{"score":84,"url":"https://www.metacritic.com/game/pc/heavenly-bodies?ftag=MCD-06-10aaa1f"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1138850/1097801194/8de2e2bace9cd671180da1c53c21ccba2f0f6003/1763978224/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763979634","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1138850/1097801194/8de2e2bace9cd671180da1c53c21ccba2f0f6003/1763978224/dash_h264.mpd?t=1763979634","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai